Repurposing Hub with SMILES annotations.\", \"name\": \"broad_repurposing_hub_molecule_with_smiles.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Curated gene sets from MouseMine.\", \"name\": \"mousemine_m2_curated_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Cell type signature gene sets from MouseMine.\", \"name\": \"mousemine_m8_celltype_signature_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Predicted microRNA targets from miRDB.\", \"name\": \"miRDB_v6.0_results.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Protein interactions via proximity labeling and mass spectrometry.\", \"name\": \"proximity_label-ms.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Gene-disease associations from multiple sources.\", \"name\": \"DisGeNET.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Regulatory target gene sets from MSigDB.\", \"name\": \"msigdb_human_c3_regulatory_target_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Official HPO release in obographs format\", \"name\": \"hp.obo\"}, {\"description\": \"Synthetic growth defects from genetic interactions.\", \"name\": \"synthetic_growth_defect.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"PubMed abstracts for microRNA-target interactions in miRTarBase.\", \"name\": \"miRTarBase_microRNA_target_interaction_pubmed_abtract.txt\"}, {\"description\": \"Gene expression (TPM) across human tissues from GTEx.\", \"name\": \"gtex_tissue_gene_tpm.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Precision medicine knowledge graph with 17,080 diseases and 4+ million relationships across biological scales.\", \"name\": \"kg.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Hallmark gene sets from MouseMine.\", \"name\": \"mousemine_mh_hallmark_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Raw observed datapoints from all screening and profiling experiments.\", \"name\": \"evebio_observed_points_table.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Predicted loss-of-function variants from GeneBass.\", \"name\": \"genebass_pLoF_filtered.pkl\"}, {\"description\": \"Drug-drug interactions for systemic hormonal preparations from DDInter 2.0 database.\", \"name\": \"ddinter_hormonal.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Gene ontology data for functional gene annotations.\", \"name\": \"go-plus.json\"}, {\"description\": \"Drug-drug interactions for various drugs from DDInter 2.0 database.\", \"name\": \"ddinter_various.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Cell type signatures from MSigDB.\", \"name\": \"msigdb_human_c8_celltype_signature_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Protein-protein interactions detected via affinity capture and mass spectrometry.\", \"name\": \"affinity_capture-ms.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Protein complexes reconstituted in vitro.\", \"name\": \"reconstituted_complex.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Protein expression data from Human Protein Atlas.\", \"name\": \"proteinatlas.tsv\"}, {\"description\": \"Positional gene sets from MouseMine.\", \"name\": \"mousemine_m1_positional_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Transcription factor targets from GTRD/MSigDB.\", \"name\": \"msigdb_human_c3_subset_transcription_factor_targets_from_GTRD.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Binding sites of microRNAs on target genes from miRTarBase.\", \"name\": \"miRTarBase_MicroRNA_Target_Sites.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"T-cell receptor sequences and specificity data from McPAS database.\", \"name\": \"McPAS-TCR.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Computationally derived gene sets from MSigDB.\", \"name\": \"msigdb_human_c4_computational_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Drug-drug interactions for antiparasitic products from DDInter 2.0 database.\", \"name\": \"ddinter_antiparasitic.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Drug-drug interactions for antineoplastic and immunomodulating agents from DDInter 2.0 database.\", \"name\": \"ddinter_antineoplastic.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Drug-drug interactions for respiratory system drugs from DDInter 2.0 database.\", \"name\": \"ddinter_respiratory.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Experimentally validated microRNA-target interactions from miRTarBase.\", \"name\": \"miRTarBase_microRNA_target_interaction.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Oncogenic signatures from MSigDB.\", \"name\": \"msigdb_human_c6_oncogenic_signature_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Filtered synonymous variants from GeneBass.\", \"name\": \"genebass_synonymous_filtered.pkl\"}, {\"description\": \"Metadata describing all cancer models/cell lines which are referenced by a dataset contained within the DepMap portal.\", \"name\": \"DepMap_Model.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"sgRNA knockout data for human.\", \"name\": \"sgRNA_KO_SP_human.txt\"}, {\"description\": \"Cell type marker genes for identification.\", \"name\": \"marker_celltype.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Genetic interactions between genes.\", \"name\": \"genetic_interaction.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Filtered missense variants from GeneBass.\", \"name\": \"genebass_missense_LC_filtered.pkl\"}, {\"description\": \"Protein-RNA interactions detected by affinity capture.\", \"name\": \"affinity_capture-rna.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Drug-drug interactions for blood and blood forming organs drugs from DDInter 2.0 database.\", \"name\": \"ddinter_blood_organs.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Curated human gene sets from MSigDB.\", \"name\": \"msigdb_human_c2_curated_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Gene dosage changes affecting growth.\", \"name\": \"dosage_growth_defect.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Gene dependency probability estimates for cancer cell lines, including all DepMap models.\", \"name\": \"DepMap_CRISPRGeneDependency.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Compound metadata with common identifiers from EveBio screening.\", \"name\": \"evebio_compound_table.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Gene expression in TPMs for cancer cell lines, including all DepMap models.\", \"name\": \"DepMap_OmicsExpressionProteinCodingGenesTPMLogp1.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Target subfamily bundles used for screening-to-profiling progression.\", \"name\": \"evebio_bundle_table.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Protein-protein interactions from co-fractionation experiments.\", \"name\": \"co-fractionation.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Virus-host protein-protein interactions from P-HIPSTER.\", \"name\": \"Virus-Host_PPI_P-HIPSTER_2020.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Genetic interactions rescuing phenotypes.\", \"name\": \"synthetic_rescue.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Expanded results on evebio_summary_result_table with curve fit parameters and phase categories.\", \"name\": \"evebio_detailed_result_table.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Prediction data for TXGNN.\", \"name\": \"txgnn_prediction.pkl\"}, {\"description\": \"Protein-protein interactions detected by yeast two-hybrid assays.\", \"name\": \"two-hybrid.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Ontology-based gene sets from MouseMine.\", \"name\": \"mousemine_m5_ontology_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Drug-drug interactions for dermatological drugs from DDInter 2.0 database.\", \"name\": \"ddinter_dermatological.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Assay metadata with one row per assay from EveBio pharmome mapping.\", \"name\": \"evebio_assay_table.csv\"}, {\"description\": \"Drug phases, mechanisms of action, and target information from Broad Institute.\", \"name\": \"broad_repurposing_hub_phase_moa_target_info.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Human positional gene sets from MSigDB.\", \"name\": \"msigdb_human_c1_positional_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Name mapping for TXGNN.\", \"name\": \"txgnn_name_mapping.pkl\"}, {\"description\": \"Hallmark gene sets from MSigDB.\", \"name\": \"msigdb_human_h_hallmark_geneset.parquet\"}, {\"description\": \"Genome-wide CRISPR gene effect estimates for cancer cell lines, including all DepMap models.\", \"name\": \"DepMap_CRISPRGeneEffect.csv\"}]"^^xsd:string .

